{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_20","type":"reasoning","text":"**Optimizing text extraction**\n\nI need to find a cleaner way to process chunks of text. Maybe I can use the `pdftotext` tool to extract raw text and specify a range for better organization. It feels like that could streamline things and make the information more manageable. I wonder if this will improve clarity for users. I'm curious how this approach will change the overall structure and usability of the content once it's all cleaned up."}}
