      "text": "Image-based impostor rendering with positional and directional discretization can display dense animated crowds in large virtual urban environments at interactive rates.",
      "short_title": "Impostors enable real-time crowds",
      "evidence_excerpts": [
        "To display many different individual people at interactive frame rates, we combined texture compression with multipass rendering.",
